 the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids runs from 1951 to 2025, and April to May came in under 90% of normal in 37 of those 75 years. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 152% of normal in April to May but only 45% in November to December. Every one of the 6 grids had its driest year in 1963, with grid 20568 at 54% of normal that year.</p>"}
